  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Demonstrations for the wiki page <b>Targets</b>. Target slots and Target
    Paths, and the Animations-child layout.\n\nEach frame is 960 x 540 (16:9). In
    play mode the board starts focused on frame 1: Tab moves to the next, number
    keys jump, Home shows them all, H shows the index. With a frame focused, <b>Space</b>
    plays its demonstration, <b>R</b> puts it back and <b>L</b> loops it - set the
    Game view to 16:9 and the frame fills it exactly. \n\nSelect a frame to see in
    its Inspector what to capture and where it goes on the page. Assets/Showcase/SHOTLIST.md
    lists every shot."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f44eed8c3b5782c408b32755e14054d5, type: 2}
